Package: libncrystal4
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: thermal neutron transport in crystals and other materials (library)
 NCrystal is a library for thermal neutron transport in crystals and other
 materials, used by Monte Carlo simulation codes and analysis tools. It
 includes a library of standard material data.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

