Package: python3-ncrystal-verify
Section: python
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-ncrystal (= ${source:Version}), ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: thermal neutron transport in crystals and other materials (tests)
 NCrystal is a library for thermal neutron transport in crystals and other
 materials, used by Monte Carlo simulation codes and analysis tools.
 .
 This package contains the ncrystal-verify command, which runs the NCrystal
 test suite against the installed NCrystal.

Package: ncrystal
Architecture: any
Depends: python3-ncrystal (= ${source:Version}),
         libncrystal-dev (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-matplotlib,
            python3-spglib,
            python3-gemmi,
            python3-ncrystal-verify
Suggests: python3-ase
Description: thermal neutron transport in crystals and other materials
 NCrystal is a library for thermal neutron transport in crystals and other
 materials, used by Monte Carlo simulation codes and analysis tools.
 .
 This package contains the command-line tools (ncrystal, nctool,
 ncrystal-config, ...), and depends on all other NCrystal packages.
